-- This deck tests usage of reservoir coupling. 

-- This case is a pure prediction case (no history). The master model includes one grid cell 
-- and no wells. The master deck is used only for controlling production and injection 
-- from the two slave models. 

-- rc_m2/slavenet2: as rc_m2/slavenet (TEST2A_SN_FLOW.DATA), but the wells of the slave RES-1 are in
-- groups WG-B and WG-D below the fixed-pressure nodes MANI-B and MANI-D (T2A_SN2_MOD1_FLOW.DATA), and
-- PLAT-A is at 52 bar.  Tests that the pressure of the master reaches wells that are not in the node
-- itself: the THP limit of such a well is the pressure of its group's node, that is the master's
-- pressure plus the pressure drop in the branch.  At 52 bar the limit is more than the D wells can
-- deliver (they shut at a pressure above about 44 bar), so the network of the slave has no solution
-- for part of its nodes.  The slave takes several time steps per sync step (TUNING in the slave deck),
-- but receives the pressures of the master in the first one only; the limits of the later steps must
-- be those of that exchange, not the limits of the wells' own records.  The slave RES-2 is the one of
-- rc_m2/t2a.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUNSPEC
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

DIMENS
 1 1 1 /

OIL
WATER
GAS
DISGAS
VAPOIL

METRIC

START
 1 'OCT' 2018 /


EQLDIMS
 1 1*  25 /


VFPPDIMS
--max.rate  max.THP   max.fw   max.fg   max.ALQ    max.tabs
  25        15        15       15       0          60       /


UDQDIMS
 16 16 0 5 /

UDADIMS
 5 /
--
--
WELLDIMS
--max.well  max.con/well  max.grup  max.w/grup
 5        10            10        10   /

--
TABDIMS
--ntsfun     ntpvt  max.nssfun  max.nppvt  max.ntfip  max.nrpvt
  1          1      50          60         72         60 /


--
UNIFIN
UNIFOUT

NETWORK
 5 3 /


------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GRID
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

--
NEWTRAN

--
GRIDFILE
 0  1 /

--
GRIDUNIT
METRES  /

--
INIT

SPECGRID
 1 1 1 1 F /

COORD
  2000.0000  2000.0000  2000.0000   2000.0000  2000.0000  2002.5000
  2100.0000  2000.0000  2000.0000   2100.0000  2000.0000  2002.5000
  2000.0000  2100.0000  2000.0000   2000.0000  2100.0000  2002.5000
  2100.0000  2100.0000  2000.0000   2100.0000  2100.0000  2002.5000
/

ZCORN
  2000.0000  2000.0000  2000.0000  2000.0000  2002.5000  2002.5000
  2002.5000  2002.5000 /


PORO
 0.25 /
  
PERMX
 2100 /

COPY
 PERMX PERMY /
 PERMX PERMZ /
/

MULTIPLY
 'PERMZ' 0.1 /
/

RPTGRID
 'ALLNNC' /

